From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: abg-OAI <abg@openai.com>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 22:38:38 -0700
Subject: Add active goal editing

Goal mode previously let the model create a goal and change its status,
but it could not correct an objective that no longer described the
user-authorized outcome.

Add `saffron.edit_active_goal` for root goal threads and the hidden
Saffron supervisor. Root calls select the live goal at execution time;
supervisor calls retain the revision captured before the helper starts.
An atomic active-goal update rejects stale objectives, status changes,
and replacements without adding a fork-owned database migration.

Allow one optional supervisor edit before its existing required
disposition action, and teach the supervisor to preserve explicit user
requirements rather than using the objective as a progress log.

